dc178a2163b79, https://si.imgix.net/9ae9394c/uploads/origins/ec8819bb-9e36-41b3-8952-06c5d244b096?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29c895a42de83dfc211a7824ff9c8736 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9ae9394c/uploads/origins/ec8819bb-9e36-41b3-8952-06c5d244b096?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd7e7dfa26b5f5842339b51ab0e18a43 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I really like your art! Would you be able to draw my two OCs who are close friends that work dangerous jobs together? The black haired one is more serious and smokes cigarettes a lot, the silver haired friend is more carefree and likes to joke with her friend. They have a chemistry of being caring for one another and even in love, but that romance is apart of their close friendship \nBlack haired: https://imgur.com/a/PYFzwjn Silver haired: https:// imgur.com/a/oaiAqQL Here's them together: https://imgur.com/a/jseLkbV", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mmm_ma_pmpm/works/64", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5c02765f/uploads/origins/0ae09881-ae12-4659-8e3b-fce705c9d624?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=989c8aec9ad6e62429974cd26227dc4c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5c02765f/uploads/origins/0ae09881-ae12-4659-8e3b-fce705c9d624?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=989c8aec9ad6e62429974cd26227dc4c, https://si.imgix.net/5c02765f/uploads/origins/0ae09881-ae12-4659-8e3b-fce705c9d624?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efdd49c5c2541568926ac0cba72784e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5c02765f/uploads/origins/0ae09881-ae12-4659-8e3b-fce705c9d624?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bcc5e5509032ca3618ba7552daba22e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんら！わにと申します。\nTRPGで使用した探索者の一枚絵をお願いしたいです。\n\n❤️OC\n　 男 / 17歳 / 171cm\n\n・高校三年生 / オカ